{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QdejPKWsowYpN6HDuqrtBo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Capstone — air-quality PM2.5 forecasting (regression)\n2\t\n3\t`data/airquality_history.csv` is a daily history (`date, pm25_lag1, temperature, humidity, wind_speed, pressure, precipitation, pm25`) where `pm25` is the measured air quality and `pm25_lag1` is the previous day's value. `data/forecast_days.csv` holds later days WITHOUT `pm25` — predict it for each.\n4\t\n5\tBuild the full pipeline on the platform:\n6\t1. Engineer features (weather + lag/rolling air-quality signals) into a feature group `airqfdfb59`.\n7\t2. Assemble a training dataset `airqtdfdfb59`.\n8\t3. Train a PM2.5 regressor and register it as `airqmodelfdfb59` WITH its evaluation metrics.\n9\t4. Predict every row of `forecast_days.csv` into a feature table `airqpredfdfb59` (record key `date`, column `pm25_pred`).\n10\t\n11\tTarget: RMSE ≤ 2.224 µg/m³ on the held-out days (train-mean baseline ≈ 2.626).\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e0451e92-c434-42a8-ab74-079910c124e6","uuid":"d42e3c0e-7171-46ee-9e7a-6f338523785f","timestamp":"2026-07-01T09:18:39.958Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/wolffbe/workspace/banter/testbed/results/19_db-full-cli-sdk-skills-sonnet/claude-sonnet-4-6/databricks/sdk/0.117.0/official/capstone/airquality/1/task/data/task.md","content":"# Capstone — air-quality PM2.5 forecasting (regression)\n\n`data/airquality_history.csv` is a daily history (`date, pm25_lag1, temperature, humidity, wind_speed, pressure, precipitation, pm25`) where `pm25` is the measured air quality and `pm25_lag1` is the previous day's value. `data/forecast_days.csv` holds later days WITHOUT `pm25` — predict it for each.\n\nBuild the full pipeline on the platform:\n1. Engineer features (weather + lag/rolling air-quality signals) into a feature group `airqfdfb59`.\n2. Assemble a training dataset `airqtdfdfb59`.\n3. Train a PM2.5 regressor and register it as `airqmodelfdfb59` WITH its evaluation metrics.\n4. Predict every row of `forecast_days.csv` into a feature table `airqpredfdfb59` (record key `date`, column `pm25_pred`).\n\nTarget: RMSE ≤ 2.224 µg/m³ on the held-out days (train-mean baseline ≈ 2.626).\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
